			"color":"#322",
			"widgets_values":[
				"# Global Setting\nXiao Qi: {@picture1}{@audio1} A silver-haired witch in a white wizard hat and cream-colored robe with gold trim, holding a crescent-and-eight-pointed-star staff.\nMonster: A colossal monster with gray-green scaled armor, sharp fangs and claws, roughly three stories tall.\nScene: A modern city street surrounded by high-rises, daytime, dust filling the air, with utility poles and cars.\n\n#  Visual\nStyle: Monster disaster, hero's entrance, cinematic quality, hyper-realistic. No sluggish or stiff action, no illogical sequences.\nColor & Tone: Cold gray city palette accented with golden laser light, medium contrast, balanced saturation, natural daylight, smooth light-to-shadow transitions, with a subtle film-grain texture.\n\n# Content\nShot 1 | 0–2s | Fixed full shot: A three-story-tall gray-green monster stands in the middle of a city street, surrounded by high-rises. The monster opens its massive jaws and lets out a roar, dust billowing across the street, cars tilted to the side.\nShot 2 | 2–4s | Medium shot, camera pushes in quickly: Xiao Qi enters from the right side of the frame and stops. She raises the crescent-and-eight-pointed-star staff in her right hand, pointing it at the monster. A golden laser shoots from the staff's tip and strikes the monster. She declares loudly in Chinese: \"变成小虫子吧！\"\nShot 3 | 4–6s | Close-up at her feet, low-angle shot: The monster shrinks into a small beetle and lands on the ground. Xiao Qi's white tall boot lifts and stomps down, crushing the beetle flat.\nShot 4 | 6–10s | Full shot, camera slowly pulls back: Crowds on both sides of the street raise their hands in cheers. Xiao Qi turns around, her cape swirling, and walks toward the depths of the frame. Her silhouette is resolute, silver hair and cape flowing in the wind."
			],
